# Webex AI Agent Studio — Design System Rules

## CRITICAL DIRECTIVE: Single Source of Truth

**Design tokens are the Single Source of Truth**, delivered through `web/src/index.css` imports:

Do NOT rely on hardcoded hex values, arbitrary pixel values, or invented CSS variables. You MUST read all color, typography, background, spacing, blur, border-radius, and border-width tokens from the token chain below:

```
web/src/index.css
  ├── @import './tokens/color-tokens.css'
  ├── @import './tokens/font-tokens.css'
  ├── @import './tokens/effect-tokens.css'
  ├── @import './tokens/border-radius-tokens.css'
  ├── @import './tokens/border-width-tokens.css'
  ├── @import './tokens/spacing-tokens.css'
  ├── @import './tokens.css'         # App :root aliases only (--bg-*, --text-*, …)
  ├── @import './app-background.css' # Full-app shell backgrounds (Brand Visuals Library)
  └── @import './components.css'    # Layout + component class rules (not variables)
```

**`web/src/tokens.css`** holds **only** the `:root` semantic aliases (pure variables). **`web/src/components.css`** holds **all** selectors (`.btn`, `.card`, layout, etc.).

**Never** invent new CSS variables. If a token does not exist, use the closest semantic token already defined. When in doubt, open the token file and find the exact variable name.

