## 1. Token Architecture

All design tokens originate from the Figma design system and are extracted into dedicated CSS files. The `:root` block in **`tokens.css`** maps Momentum Design System tokens (`--mds-*`) to shorter semantic aliases (`--bg-*`, `--text-*`, `--accent-*`, etc.). You MUST use these aliases throughout the application.

### Semantic Aliases (defined in `tokens.css` `:root`)

