### Theming

The system supports dark (default) and light themes. Color tokens in `color-tokens.css` are defined under:
- `:root, [data-theme="dark"]` — dark theme (default)
- `[data-theme="light"]` — light theme
- `@media (prefers-color-scheme: light)` — OS-level auto-detection

All semantic aliases in `tokens.css` resolve through Momentum tokens (`--mds-*`) which are theme-aware. Do NOT hardcode theme-specific hex values.

### Application shell background

**Figma:** [WxCC-6290 — .Core - App Shell](https://www.figma.com/design/N2MRxdIlw8NiWTmVXwgFUL/WxCC-6290-BYO-LLM-for-AI-Agent?node-id=38116-24598) (`38116-24598`).

**Code:** `web/src/app-background.css` + `web/src/assets/app-shell-bg.png`.

**Structure (matches Figma exactly):**
1. `.app-background` — `position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0` with solid black base (`--color-theme-background-solid-primary-normal`)
2. `.app-background__image` — the gradient image at `opacity: 0.9`, covering the full viewport
3. Header and sidebar are **transparent** — the gradient image shows through seamlessly
4. `.primary-content` (Figma `.Page Content`) — glass overlay: `backdrop-filter: blur(400px)` + `background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4)` + `border-radius: 16px 0 0 0` (top-left only)

