## 2. Component Library

### Location
Component and layout **class rules** live in **`web/src/components.css`** (imported by `index.css`). **Variables** live in **`tokens.css`** and `./tokens/*.css`. Momentum Design web components (`mdc-button`, `mdc-badge`, `mdc-toggle`, etc.) are available via `@momentum-design/components`.

### Buttons

Pill-shaped buttons with full-radius corners. Primary buttons use inverted colors (light text on dark, dark text on light).

```css
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 8px 20px;
  border-radius: 100px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--text-primary);
  color: var(--bg-primary);
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  border: 1px solid var(--outline-color);
}

.btn-secondary:hover {
  background: var(--button-secondary-active);
}

.btn-sm {
  padding: 6px 16px;
  font-size: 13px;
}
```

### Cards

Glass-effect cards with subtle borders. Nested cards inside `.secondary-content` use transparent backgrounds.

```css
.card {
  background: var(--bg-glass);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.secondary-content .card {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin-bottom: 0;
}
```

### Badges

Compact semantic indicators with alert-colored backgrounds and borders.

```css
.badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 20px;
  border: 1px solid;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.badge-success { background: var(--success-bg); border-color: var(--success-color); }
.badge-warning { background: var(--warning-bg); border-color: var(--warning-color); }
.badge-danger  { background: var(--danger-bg);  border-color: var(--danger-color); }
.badge-info    { background: var(--color-theme-background-alert-theme-normal); border-color: var(--accent-color); }
```

### Label Chips

Color-coded labels using the Momentum label palette (cobalt, violet, purple, pink, orange, gold, lime, mint, slate). Each uses `--color-theme-background-label-{color}-normal` and `--color-theme-outline-label-{color}` tokens from `color-tokens.css`.

### Alert Chips

Semantic alert chips with matching icon colors (default, error, warning, success, info). Use alert background tokens from `color-tokens.css`.

### Toggle Switches

```css
.toggle-slider {
  width: 40px;
  height: 22px;
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-radius: 11px;
}

.toggle-input:checked + .toggle-slider {
  background-color: var(--accent-color);
}
```

### Segment Control (Pills)

Pill-shaped segmented control with glass background.

```css
.segment-control {
  display: inline-flex;
  background: var(--bg-glass);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 4px;
  gap: 4px;
}

.segment-item {
  padding: 6px 16px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  border-radius: 16px;
}

.segment-item.active {
  background: var(--button-secondary-active);
  color: var(--text-primary);
}
```

### Tabs (Pill Style)

Momentum Design pill tabs. Active state uses solid tertiary background. No underline.

```css
.tab {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  height: 32px;
  padding: 0 12px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
}

.tab.active {
  color: var(--text-primary);
  background: var(--color-theme-background-solid-tertiary-normal);
}

.tab:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-theme-outline-theme-normal);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}
```

Tab badges use `var(--color-theme-background-accent-normal)` background with `100px` border-radius.

### Tables

```css
.table-container {
  overflow: hidden;
}

th {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

th, td {
  padding: 14px 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

tbody tr:hover {
  background: var(--button-secondary-active);
}
```

### Radio

React: `Radio`, `RadioGroup` from `web/src/components/shared/Radio.tsx`. Classes: `.radio`, `.radio-input`, `.radio-circle`, `.radio-label`, `.radio-group`.

### Progress Bar

React: `ProgressBar` from `web/src/components/shared/ProgressBar.tsx`. Classes: `.progress-bar`, `.progress-bar--inline`, `.progress-bar__track`, `.progress-bar__fill`, status modifiers `.progress-bar--success` / `.progress-bar--failed`. Track/fill colors use `var(--accent-color)`, `var(--success-color)`, `var(--danger-color)` and neutral track grays in `components.css`.

### Popover

React: `Popover` from `web/src/components/shared/Popover.tsx` (portal + anchor positioning). Classes: `.popover-backdrop`, `.popover-surface`, `.popover-surface--tonal`, `.popover-surface--contrast`, `.popover-close`, `.popover-body`.

### Pagination

React: `Pagination` from `web/src/components/shared/Pagination.tsx`. Classes: `.pagination`, `.pagination-capacity`, `.pagination-nav`, `.pagination-icon-btn`, `.pagination-pill-btn`, `.pagination-select`, `.pagination-jump`. Uses `.form-input` on compact selects.

### Tooltip & Toggle Tip

[Figma — Momentum Web Tooltip](https://www.figma.com/design/9qhjTsC97Q3W8ZsbnTiZho/%F0%9F%A7%A9-Momentum-Web---Component-Library?node-id=46-2331) (`46-2331`): **Popover – Tonal** shell (Figma `.Popover Base` vector: rounded rect + soft edge). Implemented as **`TooltipTonalBackdrop`** (inlined SVG so `--fill-0` / `--stroke-0` resolve from `tokens.css`). Shell uses `12px` padding, inner `gap: 8px`, text **14px / 20px**, `max-width: 400px`, `var(--surface-tooltip-tonal-shadow)`.

React: `Tooltip`, `ToggleTip` from `Tooltip.tsx`; tonal SVG layer from `TooltipTonalBackdrop.tsx`. `Popover` (tonal) and `Slider` value tooltip reuse the same backdrop.

| Piece | Classes |
|--------|---------|
| Hover/focus bubble | `.tooltip-wrapper`, `.tooltip-bubble`, `.tooltip-text` |
| Click-to-toggle (link + close) | `.tooltip-bubble.tooltip-interactive`, `.toggletip-content`, `.toggletip-link`, `.toggletip-close` |
| Arrow | `.tooltip-bubble::after` + `[data-placement=*]` |

Styling lives in **`components.css`** (radius `var(--border-radius-large)`, border `var(--outline-color)`). Documentation: [Momentum Tooltip — Storybook](https://momentum-design.github.io/momentum-design/storybook-static/index.html?path=/docs/components-tooltip--docs).

