### Text link (Standalone & Inline)

[Figma — Link sticker sheet](https://www.figma.com/design/9qhjTsC97Q3W8ZsbnTiZho/%F0%9F%A7%A9-Momentum-Web---Component-Library?node-id=46864-23490) (`46864-23490`): **Standalone Link** and **Inline Link**, repeated for theme sticker columns; size rows ~24px / 20px / 16px line height; optional wider variant with trailing icon.

React: `TextLink` from `web/src/components/shared/TextLink.tsx`. Use **`variant="standalone"`** for isolated links, **`variant="inline"`** inside paragraphs. Pass **`iconTrailing`** (Momentum `IconName`) for the icon variant. **`target="_blank"`** merges user **`rel`** with **`noopener`** / **`noreferrer`**. **`disabled`** renders `<span role="link" aria-disabled>` (no navigation).

**Global empty state:** pass `global` to center the block in the main region; `graphicSize` maps to Figma max width **496px** (large) or **316px** (medium/small). Use `layout="horizontal"` for horizontal symbols.

`get_design_context` from Figma MCP may require a selected layer in the desktop plugin; **`get_metadata`** with `fileKey` + `nodeId` works for structure when implementing from node IDs.

### Form Inputs (Momentum Design)

```css
.form-input {
  width: 100%;
  height: 32px;
  padding: 5px 6px 5px 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--outline-color);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-size: 14px;
}

.form-input:focus {
  border-color: var(--outline-color);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--bg-primary),
    0 0 0 4px var(--accent-color),
    0 0 0 5px rgba(100, 180, 250, 0.35);
}

/* Error state */
.form-input.error { border-color: var(--danger-color); }
.form-input.success { border-color: var(--success-color); }
.form-input.warning { border-color: var(--warning-color); }
```

### Modals

```css
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  background: var(--color-theme-background-overlay-normal);
  z-index: 1000;
}

.modal {
  background: var(--bg-secondary);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: 16px;
