## 4. Icon System

### Implementation

Icons use the **Momentum Design Icon System** via `@momentum-design/icons` and the `mdc-icon` web component. A typed React wrapper is available at `web/src/icons/Icon.tsx`.

```tsx
import { Icon } from '../icons';

<Icon name="search" weight="bold" size="lg" />
<Icon name="camera" weight="regular" size={40} color="var(--accent-color)" />
<Icon name="alert" weight="bold" size="sm" ariaLabel="Alert" />
```

Requires `<IconProvider iconSet="momentum-icons">` ancestor (already configured in `App.tsx`).

### Icon Sizing

| Preset | Pixels | CSS Utility Class |
|--------|--------|-------------------|
| `xs` | 12px | `.icon-xs` |
| `sm` | 16px | `.icon-sm` |
| `md` | 20px | `.icon-md` |
| `lg` | 24px | `.icon-lg` |
| `xl` | 32px | `.icon-xl` |

### Icon Color Utilities

```css
mdc-icon { --mdc-icon-fill-color: currentColor; }
.icon-accent  { --mdc-icon-fill-color: var(--mds-color-theme-text-accent-normal); }
.icon-success { --mdc-icon-fill-color: var(--mds-color-theme-text-success-normal); }
.icon-warning { --mdc-icon-fill-color: var(--mds-color-theme-text-warning-normal); }
.icon-error   { --mdc-icon-fill-color: var(--mds-color-theme-text-error-normal); }
.icon-muted   { --mdc-icon-fill-color: var(--mds-color-theme-text-secondary-normal); }
```

### Icon Types

895 icons available with `regular` and `bold` weight variants. Full TypeScript types are in `web/src/icons/types.ts`. Categories (Action, AI, Alerts, Audio & Video, Brand, Chat, Communication, Content, Emoji, Feedback, Formatting, Layout, Navigation, Objects, People, Presence) are in `web/src/icons/catalog.ts`.

### Common Icons Used
- **Navigation**: `dashboard`, `bot`, `document`, `connect`, `settings`
- **Actions**: `plus`, `edit`, `delete`, `search`, `filter`, `close-space`
- **Status**: `check-circle`, `warning`, `error-legacy`, `info-circle`
- **UI**: `search`, `alert`, `help-circle`, `arrow-down`, `more`

