Agent avatar: 64px circle with gradient background (`linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%)`).

### Content Layering

Every page follows a two-layer card system:
1. **`.primary-content`** — Dark glass container (`rgba(0,0,0,0.4)`, 12px radius, 24px padding)
2. **`.secondary-content`** — Light glass container (`rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`, 12px radius, 20px padding) nested inside

