### Interactive States

```css
/* Hover - uses button secondary active token */
:hover { background: var(--button-secondary-active); }

/* Active/Selected - uses accent bg */
.active {
  color: var(--text-primary);
  background: var(--color-theme-background-solid-tertiary-normal);
}

/* Disabled */
:disabled {
  opacity: 0.4;
  cursor: not-allowed;
  pointer-events: none;
}
```

### Semantic Status Colors

| Status | Text Color | Background |
|--------|------------|------------|
| Success | `var(--success-color)` | `var(--success-bg)` |
| Warning | `var(--warning-color)` | `var(--warning-bg)` |
| Error/Danger | `var(--danger-color)` | `var(--danger-bg)` |
| Info | `var(--accent-color)` | `var(--color-theme-background-alert-theme-normal)` |

