## 7. Modal Pattern

Modals use the secondary background with glass border, centered with overlay backdrop.

```css
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: var(--color-theme-background-overlay-normal);
  z-index: 1000;
}

.modal {
  background: var(--bg-secondary);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: 16px;
  width: 640px;
  max-height: 90vh;
}

.modal-header { padding: 20px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
.modal-body   { padding: 24px; max-height: 60vh; overflow-y: auto; }
.modal-footer { padding: 16px 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
```

Modal close button: 32px, rounded, transparent background, hover uses `var(--button-secondary-active)`.

