## 10. File Structure

```
web/src/
├── index.css                    # Entry: imports tokens + tokens.css + components.css
├── tokens.css                   # App :root aliases only (semantic variables)
├── components.css               # Resets, layout, .btn/.card/.wizard-step, etc.
├── tokens/
│   ├── color-tokens.css         # Dark + Light theme colors (from Figma)
│   ├── font-tokens.css          # Type scale, weights, line heights
│   ├── effect-tokens.css        # Blur values
│   ├── border-radius-tokens.css # Radius scale
│   ├── border-width-tokens.css  # Border widths
│   └── spacing-tokens.css       # 4px grid spacing scale
├── icons/
│   ├── Icon.tsx                 # Typed React Icon component
│   ├── types.ts                 # IconName + IconWeight types (895 icons)
│   ├── catalog.ts               # Category groupings + helpers
│   └── index.ts                 # Barrel exports
├── components/
│   ├── layout/                  # Header, Sidebar, MainLayout
│   └── shared/                  # Dropdown, reusable components
├── pages/                       # Route pages
├── contexts/                    # React contexts (AppContext)
└── App.tsx                      # Root: ThemeProvider + IconProvider + Router
```

